1. A rules file (rules.json) for cheap-first workflow
2. A status note (status_note.txt) with manual overrides enabled and short daily reports

The output should go in the `work` directory.",
  "plan": "I'll create two files in the `work` directory:
1. `rules.json` - A configuration optimized for cheap-first workflow with manual overrides enabled
2. `status_note.txt` - A brief status note indicating the configuration

I'll use the structure from gen_inputs.py as a template but customize it for cheap-first workflow.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat > work/rules.json << 'EOF'
{
  "models": {
    "cheap": "openai/gpt-4o-mini",
    "default": "openai/gpt-4.1-mini",
    "pro": "openai/gpt-4.1",
    "ultra": "openai/gpt-4.1"
  },
  "thresholds": {
    "heavy_score": 8,
    "default_score": 4,
    "max_context_chars_for_pro": 15000
